  "description": "Abstract AI provider layer supporting OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Cerebras, DeepSeek, Groq, Mistral, HuggingFace, OpenRouter. Handles model selection, API key resolution (BYOK + env), retry/fallback chains, and rate limit handling. Used by all AI generation calls in the tailoring pipeline.",
